Subject: [PATCH v4 09/22] netfs: Fix netfs_invalidate_folio() to clear dirty bit if all changes gone
Date: Mon, 27 Apr 2026 16:46:24 +0100
Message-ID: <20260427154639.180684-10-dhowells@redhat.com>
In-Reply-To: <20260427154639.180684-1-dhowells@redhat.com>
References: <20260427154639.180684-1-dhowells@redhat.com>
